     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><a name=\"EmsDiagnosis2Fhir\"/><a name=\"hcEmsDiagnosis2Fhir\"/><p>Mapping from (not specified) to (not specified)</p><br/><p><b>Group 1 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"StructureDefinition-logicalmodel-ems-protocol.html\">EMS Protocol</a> to <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ch-ems-composition.html\">CH EMS Composition</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-logicalmodel-ems-protocol.html#EMSProtocol.diagnosis\">EMSProtocol.diagnosis</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-ch-ems-composition-definitions.html#Composition.section:diagnosis\">Composition.section:diagnosis</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 2 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"StructureDefinition-logicalmodel-ems-protocol.html\">EMS Protocol</a> to <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ch-ems-observation-diagnosis.html\">CH EMS Observation: Diagnosis</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-logicalmodel-ems-protocol.html#EMSProtocol.diagnosis.type\">EMSProtocol.diagnosis.type</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-ch-ems-observation-diagnosis-definitions.html#Observation.code\">Observation.code</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-logicalmodel-ems-protocol.html#EMSProtocol.diagnosis.author\">EMSProtocol.diagnosis.author</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-ch-ems-observation-diagnosis-definitions.html#Observation.performer\">Observation.performer</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-logicalmodel-ems-protocol.html#EMSProtocol.diagnosis.icd10\">EMSProtocol.diagnosis.icd10</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-ch-ems-observation-diagnosis-definitions.html#Observation.value[x].coding:icd10\">Observation.value[x].coding:icd10</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 3 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"StructureDefinition-logicalmodel-ems-protocol.html\">EMS Protocol</a> to <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ch-ems-practitioner.html\">CH EMS Practitioner</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-logicalmodel-ems-protocol.html#EMSProtocol.diagnosis.author.name\">EMSProtocol.diagnosis.author.name</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-ch-ems-practitioner-definitions.html#Practitioner.name\">Practitioner.name</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-logicalmodel-ems-protocol.html#EMSProtocol.diagnosis.author.name.firstName\">EMSProtocol.diagnosis.author.name.firstName</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.htm